# Hanging Door Open Sign

Status: DONE
Milestone: M32 A welcoming sign behind the door glass
Dependencies: 36_PAINTERLY_WINDOWLIT_INTERIOR.todo

## Purpose

The owner requests a cute "We are OPEN" sign behind the entrance door's glass.
It belongs to the moving door, not the parallax room or an interactive control.

## Tasks

- [x] Preserve the affected entrance template, stylesheet and source tests.
- [x] Add a cream/deep-green hanging plaque with cord, brass details and a small heart.
- [x] Place the glass reflection above the sign and retain the transparent room view.
- [x] Keep exact wording, no independent animation and no extra interaction.
- [x] Add and pass focused source tests.
- [x] Check actual glass-layer pixels, narrow/short screens and door motion.
- [x] Refresh the entrance campaign pair and include only scoped output in publication.

## Acceptance criteria

- One readable "We are OPEN" sign hangs behind the right door glass.
- Sign moves with the opening door, not with interior look-around.
- No hidden/overflowing lettering or interference with entry/skip controls.
- Existing no-JS, reduced-motion, forced-colour and resource-failure exits remain.
- No hours, order confirmation or physical-shop claim is introduced.

